{"id":"n89819-2-8","stage":3,"title":"찾아내다 · 找到","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89819-2-8-1","ko":"제 컴퓨터는 아직도 못 고치셨나요?","zh":"我的电脑您还是没修好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"컴퓨터는","meaning":"电脑","explanation":"컴퓨터：电脑；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"컴퓨터","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72167","senseId":"1","lemma":"컴퓨터","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"컴퓨터는","audio":"/audio/ba781be69a9f00d58b7d.mp3"}},{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"못","meaning":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","explanation":"못：不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","readings":[{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17254","senseId":"1","lemma":"못","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"못","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3"}},{"text":"고치셨나요?","meaning":"修补，维修","explanation":"고치다：修补，维修；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"고치다","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18381","senseId":"1","lemma":"고치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고치셨나요","audio":"/audio/69921464288eeeeccfcf.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"cff8b01657dff709","term":"컴퓨터","zh":"电脑","audio":"/audio/cff8b01657dff709abdb.mp3","entryId":"72167","definition":"利用电路线快速、准确地处理文件、照片、影像等大量数据的机器。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"89058d16546c1107","term":"못","zh":"不能、没能（能力或条件限制）","audio":"/audio/89058d16546c11076dd1.mp3","entryId":"17254","definition":"不会做动词所指的动作。","pronunciation":["몯ː"]},{"id":"594fd99add1f497b","term":"고치다","zh":"修补，维修","audio":"/audio/594fd99add1f497ba95b.mp3","entryId":"18381","definition":"修理出故障或不能用的东西，使其可重新使用。","pronunciation":["고치다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1317eb1d95b068a90c82.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89819-2-8-2","ko":"고장 난 이유를 찾아냈으니 수리만 하면 됩니다.","zh":"已经找到故障原因了，只要进行维修就行。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"고장","meaning":"故障","explanation":"고장：故障","readings":[{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18856","senseId":"1","lemma":"고장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"고장","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3"}},{"text":"난","meaning":"发生","explanation":"나다：发生；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"나다","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62210","senseId":"7","lemma":"나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"난","audio":"/audio/f123177dde5fa8f48570.mp3"}},{"text":"이유를","meaning":"理由","explanation":"이유：理由；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"이유","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62386","senseId":"1","lemma":"이유","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이유를","audio":"/audio/3b13e0c02826f1bbbdc2.mp3"}},{"text":"찾아냈으니","meaning":"找到，找出，发现","explanation":"찾아내다：找到，找出，发现；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"찾아내다","audio":"/audio/aa916a6f7cec9d78228c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89819","senseId":"2","lemma":"찾아내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"찾아냈으니","audio":"/audio/f78e93c778bc1a280e70.mp3"}},{"text":"수리만","meaning":"修理，维修","explanation":"수리：修理，维修；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"수리","audio":"/audio/b75ba9f82e45cc310fd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91787","senseId":"1","lemma":"수리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수리만","audio":"/audio/7a715346c84a6ed5315e.mp3"}},{"text":"하면","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면","audio":"/audio/01692c67203f44175054.mp3"}},{"text":"됩니다.","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됩니다","audio":"/audio/d5bd67992682ed3f7e8d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a1a759c684921a8d","term":"고장","zh":"故障","audio":"/audio/a1a759c684921a8dd35e.mp3","entryId":"18856","definition":"机器或装置等不能正常运行。","pronunciation":["고ː장"]},{"id":"1a06e246c5fb49e2","term":"나다","zh":"发生","audio":"/audio/1a06e246c5fb49e2814c.mp3","entryId":"62210","definition":"出现某种现象或事件。","pronunciation":["나다"]},{"id":"6445cb23ec9811b5","term":"이유","zh":"理由","audio":"/audio/6445cb23ec9811b5f35a.mp3","entryId":"62386","definition":"使某个结果发生的原因或根据。","pronunciation":["이ː유"]},{"id":"aa916a6f7cec9d78","term":"찾아내다","zh":"找到，找出，发现","audio":"/audio/aa916a6f7cec9d78228c.mp3","entryId":"89819","definition":"了解以前不知道的事情并对外公布。","pronunciation":["차자내다"]},{"id":"b75ba9f82e45cc31","term":"수리","zh":"修理，维修","audio":"/audio/b75ba9f82e45cc310fd1.mp3","entryId":"91787","definition":"对损坏了的东西进行修补恢复的过程。","pronunciation":["수리"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다"